OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 19 MAR
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GThe BBC Scottish Symphony
OL,6,     GOrchestra and Delyana Lazarova
OL,7,     Gperform Tchaikovsky's Symphony
OL,8,     GNo. 6 and are joined by Duo
OL,9,     GJatekok for Mendelssohn's
OL,10,     GConcerto for Two Pianos in A flat.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Scotland Rocks
OL,12,     GKenneth Steven explores the
OL,13,     Ghistory of this semi-precious
OL,14,     Gstone and reflects in poetry on
OL,15,     Ghis finds. The first stone he
OL,16,     Gfound was serpentine from the
OL,17,     Gbeaches of the island of Iona.
